    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are proud to present 26 Melville Drive to the Dublin 11 property market.\r\n\r\nThis superb two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment has been maintained to an extremely high standard, with the current owners creating a stylish, modern home.\r\n\r\nThe interior boasts a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, complemented by large windows that flood the space with natural light, and a modern kitchen. There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, along with a contemporary family bathroom.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this apartment offers a comfortable and modern living environment ready for immediate occupancy.\r\n\r\nMelville Drive benefits from an excellent range of local amenities, including schools, shops, cafés, and restaurants. The nearby Charlestown Shopping Centre offers an extensive selection of retail and leisure options, while surrounding parks and recreational facilities provide plenty of opportunities for outdoor activities. The area is exceptionally well connected, with frequent bus services and easy access to the M50, making this an ideal purchase for first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Please contact us today to register your interest.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** While we have taken care to ensure the accuracy of this information, some details may have been provided by the vendor. We do not assume responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies, and we advise all viewers to seek their own professional advice."
